.TH AC-LAUNCHER 1 "@DATE@" "AC Launcher @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ac-launcher \- launcher for Asheron's Call emulator servers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ac-launcher
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ac-launcher
keeps accounts and servers in one place and starts one or many Asheron's Call game clients at once.
The Windows game client runs through
.BR umu-run (1)
and Proton, without Steam.
Proton versions (GE-Proton and UMU-Proton) are downloaded, verified against their published checksums,
and kept in the launcher's own folder.
.PP
Account passwords are kept in the desktop keyring through
.BR secret-tool (1)
when a Secret Service keyring is available, and otherwise in the accounts file, readable only by the user.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AC_LAUNCHER_HOME
Keep every file under this one directory instead of the XDG locations below.
.TP
.BR XDG_CONFIG_HOME ", " XDG_DATA_HOME ", " XDG_CACHE_HOME ", " XDG_STATE_HOME
Base directories for the files listed below.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/ac-launcher/
Settings, accounts and user-added servers.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/ac-launcher/
The Wine prefix, installed Proton versions, and the launcher's copy of umu-launcher.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/ac-launcher/
Cached server lists and Proton release data.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/ac-launcher/logs/
The log.
.SH SECURITY
The game client takes the account password on its command line, so other users on the same computer can read it
from the process list while the game runs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR umu-run (1),
.BR secret-tool (1)
.PP
https://github.com/codingncaffeine/AC-Launcher
